publish-prod/images/260701_ICYMI-June-AI_Thumb.max-600x600.format-webp.webp"&gt;Here are Google’s latest AI updates from June 2026.</description><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 18:15:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/google-ai-updates-june-2026/</guid><category>Search</category><category>NotebookLM</category><category>Android</category><category>Arts &amp; Culture</category><category>Google DeepMind</category><category>Developer tools</category><category>Learning &amp; Education</category><category>UK</category><category>AI</category><category>Pixel</category><category>Gemini App</category><category>Gemini models</category><category>Google Research</category><category>Safety &amp; Security</category><category>Google Nest</category><og xmlns:og="http://ogp.me/ns#"><type>article</type><title>The latest AI news we announced in June 2026</title><description>Here are Google’s latest AI updates from June 2026.</description><site_name>Google</site_name><url>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/google-ai-updates-june-2026/</url></og><author xmlns:author="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><name>News from Google Team</name><title/><department/><company/></author></item><item><title>New York City educators and industry leaders gathered at Google’s offices to shape the future of AI in classrooms.</title><link>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/nyc-ai-summit/</link><media:content height="540" medium="image" url="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Summit_Photo_1.max-600x600.format-webp.webp" width="540"/><description>&lt;img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Summit_Photo_1.max-600x600.format-webp.webp"&gt;Google, the New York Jobs CEO Council and Urban Assembly hosted an AI summit for 150 education and industry leaders.</description><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/nyc-ai-summit/</guid><category>Learning &amp; Education</category><category>AI</category><og xmlns:og="http://ogp.me/ns#"><type>article</type><title>New York City educators and industry leaders gathered at Google’s offices to shape the future of AI in classrooms.</title><description/><site_name>Google</site_name><url>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/nyc-ai-summit/</url></og></item><item><title>Unlocking Britain’s next era of productivity: Building a nation of AI trailblazers</title><link>https://blog.google/company-news/inside-google/around-the-globe/google-europe/united-kingdom/unlocking-britains-next-era-of-productivity-building-a-nation-of-ai-trailblazers/</link><media:content height="540" medium="image" url="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_k2dxu1k2.max-600x600.format-webp.webp" width="540"/><media:description>Four illustrated characters representing different professional roles, including a scientist, technician, explorer, and observer.</media:description><description>&lt;img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_k2dxu1k2.max-600x600.format-webp.webp"&gt;Google UK shares its latest Economic Impact Report and how to enable more people to unlock the benefits of AI-powered technologies.</description><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.google/company-news/inside-google/around-the-globe/google-europe/united-kingdom/unlocking-britains-next-era-of-productivity-building-a-nation-of-ai-trailblazers/</guid><category>UK</category><category>AI</category><og xmlns:og="http://ogp.me/ns#"><type>article</type><title>Unlocking Britain’s next era of productivity: Building a nation of AI trailblazers</title><description>Google UK shares its latest Economic Impact Report and how to enable more people to unlock the benefits of AI-powered technologies.</description><site_name>Google</site_name><url>https://blog.google/company-news/inside-google/around-the-globe/google-europe/united-kingdom/unlocking-britains-next-era-of-productivity-building-a-nation-of-ai-trailblazers/</url></og><author xmlns:author="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><name>Kate Alessi</name><title>Vice President and Managing Director</title><department/><company>Google UK &amp; Ireland</company></author></item><item><title>Ask an AI expert: What exactly is the full stack?</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/full-stack-ai-explainer/</link><media:content height="540" medium="image" url="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Full_Stack.max-600x600.format-webp.webp" width="540"/><media:description>An illustration depicting a full-stack AI infrastructure against a dark background</media:description><description>&lt;img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Full_Stack.max-600x600.format-webp.webp"&gt;A Google expert explains what it means to take a full-stack approach to AI and why it’s been the foundation of our AI work for so long.</description><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/full-stack-ai-explainer/</guid><category>Developer tools</category><category>AI</category><og xmlns:og="http://ogp.me/ns#"><type>article</type><title>Ask an AI expert: What exactly is the full stack?</title><description>A Google expert explains what it means to take a full-stack approach to AI and why it’s been the foundation of our AI work for so long.</description><site_name>Google</site_name><url>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/full-stack-ai-explainer/</url></og><author xmlns:author="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><name>Molly McHugh-Johnson</name><title>Contributor</title><department/><company/></author></item><item><title>Our latest Google Finance upgrades, including a new app</title><link>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/google-finance-updates-june-2026/</link><media:content height="540" medium="image" url="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Google_Finance_blog_image_June_.max-600x600.format-webp.webp" width="540"/><media:description>The Google Finance logo, surrounded by elements of the user interface</media:description><description>&lt;img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Google_Finance_blog_image_June_.max-600x600.format-webp.webp"&gt;The new Google Finance is coming out of beta and launching a new Android app.</description><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/google-finance-updates-june-2026/</guid><category>Search</category><category>AI</category><og xmlns:og="http://ogp.me/ns#"><type>article</type><title>Our latest Google Finance upgrades, including a new app</title><description>The new Google Finance is coming out of beta and launching a new Android app.</description><site_name>Google</site_name><url>https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/google-finance-updates-june-2026/</url></og><author xmlns:author="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><name>Barine Tee</name><title>Principal Engineer</title><department>Search</department><company/></author></item><item><title>New research shows how AMIE, our medical AI, could help manage health conditions.</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-research/amie-for-disease-management-in-nature/</link><media:content height="540" medium="image" url="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/AMIE_Mx_Nature_Social_Visual_Va.max-600x600.format-webp.webp" width="540"/><description>&lt;img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/AMIE_Mx_Nature_Social_Visual_Va.max-600x600.format-webp.webp"&gt;Research in “Nature” shows our conversational AI system matches primary care physicians in complex disease management.</description